{"seq":1,"slug":"coordinator-pattern","title":"Coordinator 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/coordinator-pattern","wordCount":552,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"coordinator-模式\">Coordinator 模式</h1><p>Coordinator 模式将导航逻辑从 ViewController/View 中抽离，形成独立的导航层。本文介绍 Coordinator 协议设计、父子关系管理，以及 UIKit 和 SwiftUI 下的实现方式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Coordinator 模式把导航从视图层剥离出来，形成单独的导航层，围绕三个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>导航层</strong>：专门负责页面跳转与流程编排，视图不再自行 push/present</li>\n<li><strong>Coordinator 协议</strong>：定义 <code>start()</code> 等入口，统一各 Coordinator 的行为</li>\n<li><strong>父子 Coordinator 关系</strong>：子流程由子 Coordinator 负责，结束后向上回报</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心收益是<strong>职责单一与可复用</strong>：视图只管展示，导航由 Coordinator 集中管理，同一流程可以在不同上下文中被复用，也便于测试。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-coordinator\">为什么需要 Coordinator</h2><p>在没有 Coordinator 的项目中，导航逻辑散布在各个 ViewController 中：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Without[&quot;❌ 无 Coordinator&quot;]&#10;        A1[&quot;ListVC&quot;] --&gt;|push| B1[&quot;DetailVC&quot;]&#10;        B1 --&gt;|present| C1[&quot;EditVC&quot;]&#10;        C1 --&gt;|push| D1[&quot;PreviewVC&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph With[&quot;✅ 有 Coordinator&quot;]&#10;        Coord[&quot;Coordinator&quot;] --&gt;|管理| A2[&quot;ListVC&quot;]&#10;        Coord --&gt;|管理| B2[&quot;DetailVC&quot;]&#10;        Coord --&gt;|管理| C2[&quot;EditVC&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;    classDef coord fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;&#10;    class A1,B1,C1,D1 bad&#10;    class A2,B2,C2 good&#10;    class Coord coord\">graph LR\n    subgraph Without[\"❌ 无 Coordinator\"]\n        A1[\"ListVC\"] --&gt;|push| B1[\"DetailVC\"]\n        B1 --&gt;|present| C1[\"EditVC\"]\n        C1 --&gt;|push| D1[\"PreviewVC\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph With[\"✅ 有 Coordinator\"]\n        Coord[\"Coordinator\"] --&gt;|管理| A2[\"ListVC\"]\n        Coord --&gt;|管理| B2[\"DetailVC\"]\n        Coord --&gt;|管理| C2[\"EditVC\"]\n    end\n\n    classDef bad fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef good fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n    classDef coord fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n\n    class A1,B1,C1,D1 bad\n    class A2,B2,C2 good\n    class Coord coord</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>Coordinator 如何解决</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VC 间导航耦合</td>\n<td>统一由 Coordinator 管理跳转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无法复用 VC</td>\n<td>VC 不知道下一个目标，可在不同流程中复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度链接困难</td>\n<td>Coordinator 可直接跳转到任意节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试导航逻辑</td>\n<td>Coordinator 可独立于 UI 测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"coordinator-协议\">Coordinator 协议</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Coordinator: AnyObject {&#10;    var childCoordinators: [Coordinator] { get set }&#10;    func start()&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Coordinator {&#10;    func addChild(_ coordinator: Coordinator) {&#10;        childCoordinators.append(coordinator)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func removeChild(_ coordinator: Coordinator) {&#10;        childCoordinators.removeAll { $0 === coordinator }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Coordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AnyObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> childCoordinators: [Coordinator] { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">get</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Coordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> addChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coordinator: Coordinator) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        childCoordinators.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(coordinator)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> removeChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coordinator: Coordinator) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        childCoordinators.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">removeAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coordinator }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"父子-coordinator-关系\">父子 Coordinator 关系</h2><p>复杂应用中，Coordinator 形成树状层级结构：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    App[&quot;AppCoordinator&quot;] --&gt; Auth[&quot;AuthCoordinator&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt; Main[&quot;MainTabCoordinator&quot;]&#10;    Main --&gt; Home[&quot;HomeCoordinator&quot;]&#10;    Main --&gt; Profile[&quot;ProfileCoordinator&quot;]&#10;    Home --&gt; Detail[&quot;ProductDetailCoordinator&quot;]&#10;    Auth --&gt; Login[&quot;LoginFlow&quot;]&#10;    Auth --&gt; Register[&quot;RegisterFlow&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef root fill:none,stroke:#F44336&#10;    classDef branch fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef leaf fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class App root&#10;    class Auth,Main branch&#10;    class Home,Profile,Detail,Login,Register leaf\">graph TD\n    App[\"AppCoordinator\"] --&gt; Auth[\"AuthCoordinator\"]\n    App --&gt; Main[\"MainTabCoordinator\"]\n    Main --&gt; Home[\"HomeCoordinator\"]\n    Main --&gt; Profile[\"ProfileCoordinator\"]\n    Home --&gt; Detail[\"ProductDetailCoordinator\"]\n    Auth --&gt; Login[\"LoginFlow\"]\n    Auth --&gt; Register[\"RegisterFlow\"]\n\n    classDef root fill:none,stroke:#F44336\n    classDef branch fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef leaf fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class App root\n    class Auth,Main branch\n    class Home,Profile,Detail,Login,Register leaf</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"uikit-coordinator-实现\">UIKit Coordinator 实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"final class AppCoordinator: Coordinator {&#10;    var childCoordinators: [Coordinator] = []&#10;    private let window: UIWindow&#10;    private let navigationController: UINavigationController&#10;&#10;    init(window: UIWindow) {&#10;        self.window = window&#10;        self.navigationController = UINavigationController()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func start() {&#10;        window.rootViewController = navigationController&#10;        window.makeKeyAndVisible()&#10;&#10;        if AuthManager.shared.isLoggedIn {&#10;            showMainFlow()&#10;        } else {&#10;            showAuthFlow()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private func showAuthFlow() {&#10;        let authCoordinator = AuthCoordinator(navigationController: navigationController)&#10;        authCoordinator.onLoginComplete = { [weak self] in&#10;            self?.removeChild(authCoordinator)&#10;            self?.showMainFlow()&#10;        }&#10;        addChild(authCoordinator)&#10;        authCoordinator.start()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private func showMainFlow() {&#10;        let mainCoordinator = MainTabCoordinator(window: window)&#10;        addChild(mainCoordinator)&#10;        mainCoordinator.start()&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;final class AuthCoordinator: Coordinator {&#10;    var childCoordinators: [Coordinator] = []&#10;    var onLoginComplete: (() -&gt; Void)?&#10;    private let navigationController: UINavigationController&#10;&#10;    init(navigationController: UINavigationController) {&#10;        self.navigationController = navigationController&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func start() {&#10;        let loginVC = LoginViewController()&#10;        loginVC.onLoginTapped = { [weak self] in&#10;            self?.onLoginComplete?()&#10;        }&#10;        loginVC.onRegisterTapped = { [weak self] in&#10;            self?.showRegister()&#10;        }&#10;        navigationController.setViewControllers([loginVC], animated: false)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private func showRegister() {&#10;        let registerVC = RegisterViewController()&#10;        registerVC.onRegisterComplete = { [weak self] in&#10;            self?.onLoginComplete?()&#10;        }&#10;        navigationController.pushViewController(registerVC, animated: true)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">final</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppCoordinator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Coordinator </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> childCoordinators: [Coordinator] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> window: UIWindow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> navigationController: UINavigationController</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">window</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: UIWindow) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF