n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sheet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: $coordinator.presentedSheet) { route </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            sheetContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: route)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">environmentObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(coordinator)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @ViewBuilder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sheetContent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route: SwiftUICoordinator.Route) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        switch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        case</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .cart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            CartView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        default:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            EmptyView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"uikit-vs-swiftui-coordinator-对比\">UIKit vs SwiftUI Coordinator 对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>UIKit Coordinator</th>\n<th>SwiftUI Coordinator</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>导航方式</td>\n<td>UINavigationController push/present</td>\n<td>NavigationPath / sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期管理</td>\n<td>手动管理子 Coordinator</td>\n<td>@StateObject 自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态同步</td>\n<td>回调/委托</td>\n<td>@Published 绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度链接</td>\n<td>遍历 Coordinator 树</td>\n<td>直接操作 NavigationPath</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试方式</td>\n<td>验证方法调用</td>\n<td>验证 path/sheet 状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 混合项目（UIKit + SwiftUI）中，可以在 UIKit Coordinator 中嵌入 UIHostingController 来展示 SwiftUI 视图。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Coordinator 模式将导航逻辑从 View/ViewController 中抽离，形成独立导航层</li>\n<li>父子 Coordinator 形成树状结构，每个流程有独立的 Coordinator 管理</li>\n<li>UIKit Coordinator 通过 UINavigationController 和闭包回调实现</li>\n<li>SwiftUI Coordinator 通过 ObservableObject + NavigationPath 实现状态驱动导航</li>\n<li>Coordinator 使得深度链接、A/B 测试路由和导航逻辑测试变得简单</li>\n<li>在模块化项目中，每个 Feature 模块可以有自己的 Coordinator</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Coordinator 模式","id":"coordinator-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 Coordinator","id":"为什么需要-coordinator"},{"level":2,"text":"Coordinator 协议","id":"coordinator-协议"},{"level":2,"text":"父子 Coordinator 关系","id":"父子-coordinator-关系"},{"level":2,"text":"UIKit Coordinator 实现","id":"uikit-coordinator-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"SwiftUI Coordinator 实现","id":"swiftui-coordinator-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"UIKit vs SwiftUI Coordinator 对比","id":"uikit-vs-swiftui-coordinator-对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基于 DI 的测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/dependency-injection/testing-with-di"},"next":{"title":"深度链接路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/navigation-architecture/deeplink-routing"}}